<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Pagamento - Estoffe</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="../../image/Icons/favicon-96x96.png" sizes="96x96" />
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css" />
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 min-h-screen flex flex-col justify-center items-center px-4 py-12">

  <div class="max-w-md w-full bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-8 shadow-xl text-center">
    <div class="mb-6">
      <p class="text-green-950 font-serif italic text-3xl tracking-wider">Estoffe</p>
      <div class="w-12 h-[2px] bg-green-700 mx-auto mt-2"></div>
    </div>

    <span class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-green-700 block mb-1">Pedido Recebido com Sucesso!</span>
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-light text-gray-900 mb-6">Finalize o seu pagamento</h2>

    <div class="flex justify-center mb-6">
      <img src="data:image/png;base64,<%= pagamento.qrCode %>" alt="QR Code Pix" class="w-52 h-52 border-2 border-dashed border-green-800 p-2 bg-white rounded-lg shadow-sm">
    </div>

    <p class="text-base font-semibold text-gray-700 mb-4">
      Total a pagar:
      <span class="text-green-900 font-extrabold text-xl block mt-1">
        R$ <%= pagamento.total.toLocaleString('pt-BR', { minimumFractionDigits: 2 }) %>
      </span>
    </p>

    <div class="mb-6 text-left">
      <label class="block text-xs text-gray-400 mb-1 font-medium">Código Pix Copia e Cola:</label>
      <div class="flex gap-2">
        <input type="text" id="pixCode" readonly value="<%= pagamento.copiaECola %>" class="bg-gray-50 border border-gray-200 text-xs rounded-lg p-3 flex-grow focus:outline-none text-gray-600 truncate font-mono">
        <button onclick="copiarPix()" class="bg-green-950 hover:bg-green-800 text-white text-xs px-4 py-2 rounded-lg font-semibold transition cursor-pointer whitespace-nowrap">
          Copiar
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-400 leading-relaxed mb-6">
      Após o pagamento, nosso sistema identificará o recebimento automaticamente e iniciará a produção do seu estofado premium.
    </p>

    <a href="/client-dashboard" class="inline-block w-full bg-gray-100 hover:bg-gray-200 text-gray-700 font-medium text-xs uppercase tracking-widest py-3.5 rounded-lg transition">
      Ir para o Meu Perfil
    </a>
  </div>
</body>
</html>